  <diagram id="interfaces-flow" name="10 rescue_interfaces 통신 흐름">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1200" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2380" pageHeight="1380" math="0" shadow="0" background="#F6F8FC">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="if-title" value="ROKEY-7 · rescue_interfaces 통신 흐름 (1차 / 2차)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=31;fontColor=#18263C;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="36" y="24" width="2300" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="if-subtitle" value="2026-10-10 · src/rescue_interfaces/README.md 「통신별 입력과 출력」의 그림 · 연결의 원본은 SDD 명세 표(다르면 명세가 이김) · AMR1 은 PC1, AMR2 는 PC2 에서 따로 실행 · 정의가 있다는 뜻이지 노드가 구현됐다는 뜻은 아님" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;fontSize=17;fontColor=#18263C;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="36" y="83" width="2300" height="46" as="geometry" />
